  "draft_py": "# Gods Willing (M20). \"Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice\n# until end of turn. Scry 1.\" The protection grant is Feat of Resistance's verified one-of-five\n# colour Choose (B5b-it-gains-protection-choice) with its \"it\" (referent='result') replaced by\n# the sentence's own \"target creature you control\" (Ranger's Guile's selector). Identical TARGET\n# selectors form one target slot (query.spell_target_slots dedupes by repr). The Choose sits in\n# a Seq with the compiled Scry 1, so it is a resolution choice, not a mode (query.modal_choose).\ntarget_yours = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n    filter=FAnd(\n        children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n        ),\n    ),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\ndef _grant(color):\n    return A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n        'ability': KeywordAbility(\n            keyword=Keyword.PROTECTION,\n            params=(FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.COLOR_HAS, color=color),),\n        ),\n        'duration': DurationEot(),\n        'target': target_yours,\n    })\nprotection = Choose(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    options=(_grant('W'), _grant('U'), _grant('B'), _grant('R'), _grant('G')),\n)\nscry = compiled[0].effect   # the compiler's Scry 1 (B5b-scr)\nabilities = [SpellAbility(kind=SpellKind.INSTANT, effect=Seq(steps=(protection, scry)))]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].effect.steps[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Scry 1.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].effect.steps[1]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "G1 shows the five-colour choice, +PROTECTION until end of turn and Scry 1, not which colour. Packs in /tmp/claude-1000/-home-sune/2e18468a-eed7-47b5-a69b-d15b1f5fd0e8/scratchpad/round_m20/mapped/m0/gods_willing: pack_red_saves.json (red: the opponent's Shock can't target the Bear), pack_white_fails.json (white: Shock kills it). Engine scope: the stack's response window offers only counterspells, so this instant can't be cast in response to removal."
 },
